# Local electron-updater dev feed (opt-in).
#
# Copy this file to `dev-app-update.yml` (same folder) to exercise auto-update
# from an unpackaged `npm run desktop` build. When present, auto-update.ts sets
# `forceDevUpdateConfig` and checks this feed instead of the baked one.
#
# Without the copy, dev runs do NOT hit the network for updates. The real
# `dev-app-update.yml` is gitignored.
#
# Trick for testing: temporarily set the app version in package.json LOWER than
# the latest published release so the updater sees an update as available.
provider: github
owner: Reina-Agent
repo: Reina
